.SH NAME
MediaKeySession.message_event \- MediaKeySession: message event
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]Secure context:\f[R] This feature is available only in secure
contexts (HTTPS).
.PP
The \f[B]\f[CB]message\f[B]\f[R] event of the \f[CR]MediaKeySession\f[R]
interface fires when a message is generated by the content decryption
module.
.SH SYNTAX
Use the event name in methods like \f[CR]addEventListener()\f[R], or set
an event handler property.
.IP
.EX
addEventListener(\(dqmessage\(dq, (event) => { })

onmessage = (event) => { }
.EE
